      "en": "Also, if anyone competes in athletics, he isn’t crowned unless he has competed by the rules.",
      "ko": "경기하는 자가 법대로 경기하지 아니하면 면류관을 얻지 못할 것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "910be200d931d6a86951597fe247216feed496c3c60c7b3e17cb649951e57cc1",
      "translation_text_hash": "bb4299b09ffb11cb04ee45611cf417a6ddac55b394204fd7b67af6a45c380231",
